---
const title = "CASA RURAL MAXCANÚ";
const subtitle = "Bienvenidos a";
---

<section class="relative bg-palette-11 overflow-hidden py-20 rustic-paper rustic-shadow">

  <!-- Textura rústica -->
  <div class="rustic-overlay"></div>

  <!-- Motivos mayas -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 flex justify-between px-8 pointer-events-none">
    <img src="/logo-casa-rural-icono-negativo.png" class="w-auto opacity-40 " alt="" />
    <img src="/logo-casa-rural-negativo.png" class="w-auto opacity-40" alt="" />
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center px-6">

    <p class="text-lg tracking-widest uppercase text-palette-2 mb-3">
      {subtitle}
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-widest text-palette-1 leading-tight">
      {title}
    </h1>

    <div class="flex justify-center mt-6">
      <span class="block w-32 h-1 bg-palette-7 rounded-full"></span>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-palette-5 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Un refugio auténtico donde la tradición maya, la naturaleza y la tranquilidad
      se encuentran para brindarte una experiencia inolvidable.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
